{"schemaVersion":1,"id":-20013,"sections":[{"id":"script-13","name":"原始脚本 13","scripts":[13],"start":0,"count":8}],"frames":[{"kind":"dialogue","head":968,"speaker":"索菲·阿登","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-13:13:1","scriptId":13,"text":"“你们运气不错啊，正好遇上我和嘉丝莉，不然可就要完蛋啦~”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-166.webp","left":968,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1146,"speaker":"嘉丝莉·鲍恩","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-13:13:2","scriptId":13,"text":"“对不起啊，索菲又口无遮拦了，我是嘉丝莉·鲍恩，附近指挥部的守备钢舞姬。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-166.webp","left":968,"right":1146,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-13:13:3","scriptId":13,"text":"“啊，没事。她是佐伊·谢尔曼，我的随行钢舞姬，正准备去指挥部赴任。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-166.webp","left":3,"right":1146,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1146,"speaker":"嘉丝莉·鲍恩","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-13:13:4","scriptId":13,"text":"“诶？那么巧啊？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-166.webp","left":3,"right":1146,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":40,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-13:13:5","scriptId":13,"text":"“你们聊完了没，现在可是在战场……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-166.webp","left":3,"right":40,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-13:13:6","scriptId":13,"text":"“也对，那么接下来的战斗就拜托两位了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-166.webp","left":3,"right":40,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1146,"speaker":"嘉丝莉·鲍恩","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-13:13:7","scriptId":13,"text":"“嗯，长官自己注意隐蔽。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-166.webp","left":3,"right":1146,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":974,"speaker":"索菲·阿登","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-13:13:8","scriptId":13,"text":"“万一被误伤了我们可不负责任啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-166.webp","left":974,"right":1146,"section":0,"shake":false}],"summaries":[]}
